  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "In Ghoul School the player is cast as Spike O'Hara, a senior at Cool School High in a small American town. Spike is a rebel and an outcast, but is a good kid. While taking a shortcut through the graveyard home one day, he comes across a glowing skull. Intrigued, he takes it to Dr. Femur, his anatomy teacher, the next day, which happens to be the day before Halloween. Dr. Femur wants to keep it for an overnight study, and Spike reluctantly agrees, noticing that the skull appeared bigger than the day before.\n\nDuring the night, the skull begins transmitting a message to the realm of the dead. On Halloween, the dead begin their assault. The teachers and students inside are turned into zombies and demons under the control of whatever intelligence has taken over the school. Samantha Pom-Pom, the head cheerleader, is captured by the dead and held somewhere inside the school. Paranormal eliminators and members of the football team have ventured inside to find her, but have not returned. When Spike learns of the mess from the TV news, he rushes to the school and decides to rescue her himself.\n\nSpike ventures inside. The doors shut and lock behind him. There's no turning back now.\n\nSpike begins his quest with only his trusty baseball bat and battered sneakers, but can collect better weapons and shoes along the way. Among them are the straightforward sickle, embalming fluid, towel and almighty gamma gun, the strange Deweytron and taserlike Spinal Zap, and a sandwich (if it can be used as a weapon, they should have fired the cafeteria workers a LONG time ago), among other weapons. Useful items include the spring shoes, needed to reach high places, the suction shoes, which allow you to walk on the ceiling, and the Golden Apple, needed to bypass the Medusa head guarding the way to the second half of the school.\n\nGet going! You have 129 rooms to explore and Samantha is counting on you. Good luck."
    },
    {
      "langue": "fr",
      "text": "Ghoul School est un jeu d'action Nes à scrolling horizontal dans lequel vous incarnez un jeune élève d'une école frappée par la foudre. La charge électrique a libéré toutes sortes de monstres et de fantômes dans les salles de classe et les couloirs. Votre but est d'éviter tout ce beau monde pour vous échapper de l'établissement scolaire."
    },
    {
      "langue": "de",
      "text": "Eines Tages findet Spike O'Hara, ein Schüler der Cool School High, auf dem örtlichen Friedhof einen leuchtenden Schädel - ein Fund, der sich als Katastrophe herausstellen könnte. Spike bringt den Schädel zu seinem Lehrer, und von hier aus entfaltet sich unsere Geistergeschichte... Der Schädel wird zu einem Leuchtfeuer, einem Peilsender für alle Geister und Monster im Reich der Toten. Diese Dämonen aus dem Jenseits haben das Mädchen seiner Träume, Samantha Pompon, die schönste Cheerleaderin der Schule, gefangen genommen. Sie ist irgendwo in der Schule, und du musst sie finden. Alle vor dir haben versagt - aber lass dich davon nicht abschrecken."
    },
    {
      "langue": "es",
      "text": "Un día de Spike O'Hara, un estudiante de la institución académica Cool School High encontró un cráneo que brillaba intensamente en el cementerio local, un hallazgo que podría llegar a ser un desastre. Spike llevó el cráneo a su maestro y es desde aquí donde nuestra fantasmal historia se desarrolla... El cráneo terminó siendo un faro, un dispositivo de rastreo para todos los espíritus y monstruos de la región de los muertos. Estos demonios de ultratumba han capturado a la chica de tus sueños Samantha Pompon, la hermosa animadora jefe de la escuela. Ella está recluida en algún lugar de la escuela y tienes que encontrarla. (Todo el mundo antes de tí ha fallado - pero no dejes que eso te desanime.)"
    },
    {
      "langue": "it",
      "text": "In Ghoul School il giocatore interpreta Spike O'Hara, uno studente della Cool School High in una piccola città americana. Spike è un ribelle e un emarginato, ma è un bravo ragazzo. Un giorno, mentre prende una scorciatoia attraverso il cimitero di casa, si imbatte in un teschio luminoso. Incuriosito, lo porta al dottor Femur, il suo insegnante di anatomia, il giorno successivo, che sembra essere il giorno prima di Halloween. Il dottor Femur vuole tenerlo per uno studio notturno, e Spike accetta con riluttanza, notando che il cranio sembrava più grande del giorno prima."
    },
    {
      "langue": "pt",
      "text": "Um dia, Spike O'Hara, um veterano da instituição acadêmica Cool School High, encontrou um crânio brilhante no cemitério local, uma descoberta que provaria ser um desastre. Spike trouxe a caveira para o professor e é daqui que nossa história fantasmagórica se desenrola ... A caveira acabou sendo um farol, um dispositivo de retorno para todos os espíritos e monstros do reino dos mortos. Esses fantasmas de uma terra abaixo capturaram sua garota dos sonhos, Samantha Pompom, a linda líder de torcida da escola. Ela está presa em algum lugar da escola e você precisa encontrá-la. (Todo mundo antes de você falhou - mas não deixe que isso o desencoraje.)"
    }
  ],
